Feature: Ascender
  Ascender is Ctrl IQ's web interface, API and job runner for Ansible, a build of AWX. It runs in a namespace of its own that a cluster's overlay selects, installed by Ctrl IQ's operator from its published chart and one AWX resource of the tree, with its database from the PostgreSQL component, at its own hostname on the public Gateway behind its own login. Its admin password and secret key are made by the operator in the cluster and its database's password by External Secrets, so nothing secret is in the tree. The pods it starts to run playbooks reach the cluster's resolver and the world on 22 and 443 and nothing else, and are the only pods of the namespace below the restricted level.

