    When the namespace's labels, the Service, the HTTPRoute, the Probe and the AWX's web settings are read, and the application is built again for another cluster domain
    Then the namespace carries the Gateway label; the Service ascender-web selects the web pods by the operator's three labels and sends port 80 to the numbered port 8052; the route sends ascender under the cluster's domain on the https listener of public to that Service in one rule with no match and no filter; no SecurityPolicy, sign-in or firewall component is in front; the Probe has hello-route's shape at the path /api/v2/ping/ with the route's hostname; the AWX trusts the route's https origin for CSRF, marks its cookies secure, makes no Ingress and a ClusterIP Service, and turns on the web's readiness probe and both liveness probes after the supervisor's start time; and built for another domain, the route's hostname, the Probe's and the trusted origin all name it

